                        "entry_id": "a754eca7-7a9b-35ec-9d64-61112bebcdfe",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "студёней"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b9f7286f-0ff0-31ba-b94d-0727a96b5abe",
                        "entry_id": "a754eca7-7a9b-35ec-9d64-61112bebcdfe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг., нар.-поэт. очень холодный, пробирающий холодом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "38443712-71ea-499f-9dc3-536bb130d45c",
                                "sense_id": "b9f7286f-0ff0-31ba-b94d-0727a96b5abe",
                                "text": "Он любил кровавый безветренный закат солнца после студёного зимнего дня, когда здания фантастически тонут в лёгкой сизой дымке, пронзительно визжат полозья и дым из труб идёт, не колеблясь, прямо вверх густым белым столбом…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7809e066-589a-4f4f-bb25-908142cf4827",
                                "sense_id": "b9f7286f-0ff0-31ba-b94d-0727a96b5abe",
                                "text": "И вдруг мою печаль сменяет страх, // Вступает в мозг костей студёный трепет, // Дрожащих уст невнятный, слабый лепет // Едва промолвить может: Тот же прах"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "684db9fa-dbc9-4fda-a7fa-ec083ac87ccf",
                        "source_entry_id": "a754eca7-7a9b-35ec-9d64-61112bebcdfe",
                        "source_sense_id": "b9f7286f-0ff0-31ba-b94d-0727a96b5abe",
                        "target_lang_word": "frigid",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "frigid",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09c050ff-6e64-321b-8f24-c0e9354919ed",
                                        "entry_id": "0e65bb60-2982-3b41-ab3a-24f03758b39f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very cold; lacking warmth; icy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "832217b6-033d-41e7-8de3-885842025c19",
                                                "sense_id": "09c050ff-6e64-321b-8f24-c0e9354919ed",
                                                "text": "A frigid, fine rain was falling."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38fbf211-5e31-4d55-88ee-50589e0ffacb",
                                                "sense_id": "09c050ff-6e64-321b-8f24-c0e9354919ed",
                                                "text": "Reindeer are well suited to the taiga’s frigid winters. They can maintain a thermogradient between body core and the environment of up to 100 degrees, in part because of insulation provided by their fur, and in part because of counter-current vascular heat exchange systems in their legs and nasal passages."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7bacd325-fe29-3a73-ac8d-d5e9a6b93c6c",
                                        "entry_id": "0e65bb60-2982-3b41-ab3a-24f03758b39f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Chilly in manner; lacking affection or zeal; impassive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4fbdc99a-5a59-3af1-badc-74036874b246",
                                        "entry_id": "0e65bb60-2982-3b41-ab3a-24f03758b39f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sexually unresponsive, especially of a woman."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b915397d-5546-4c56-addf-dbce6e79efe9",
                                                "sense_id": "4fbdc99a-5a59-3af1-badc-74036874b246",
                                                "text": "In Italy, a plant called Pizza ugurdu is said to excite powerful erotic feelings even in the most frigid."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
